over. When one of the lodgers started an affair with Julia, Rosalie was devastated; when he later committed suicide, the relationship between mother and daughter was shattered irrevocable.Or so it seems until the spring of 1999, when Rosalie, diagnosed with leukemia, came to live with Julia for the last month of her life. At last the spell was broken, and they were able to talk with an ease they had never known before. When she was very near the end, Rosalie said to Julia, \"Now you will be able to write about me, won't you?\"The Three of Us is a memoir like no other you have read. The writing is magical, and the story is extraordinary, not only for its honest but also for its humor and its lack of blame. Ultimately, this is a tale of redemption, a love story. It will surely become one of the classics of that genre.From the Hardcover edition.","primarySubject":"Biography","primaryTopic":"Mental Health & Psychology","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Biography","confidence":"medium","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Biography","score":12,"evidenceCount":2},{"subject":"Society & Culture","score":10,"evidenceCount":2},{"subject":"Memoir & Autobiography","score":7,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Biography & Autobiography","mappedSubject":"Memoir & Autobiography","score":7,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-three-of-us-julia-blackburn","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-three-of-us-julia-blackburn-4"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Biography & Autobiography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-the-three-of-us-julia-blackburn","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-three-of-us-julia-blackburn-3"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Biography","mappedSubject":"Biography","score":6,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-summ